        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Altar-frontal (?) On the bottom of the piece of heavy white linen is sewed a deep border of hand woven lace, made in imitation of drawn-work, (punto tirato). The design is of stags, with branching horns, face to face, and separated by a vase of flowers. Below is a heavy fringe and tassels."@en ;
